|description = '''Leychal''' ('''れいちゃる'''), also known under the names '''Sakatare''' ('''さかたれ''', stylized '''㋚㋕㋟㋹''') and '''Sakata Leychal''' ('''坂田れいちゃる''') is a female {{NNDict|Utaite}} whose deeper voice is thought to sound boyish. And as it is a {{VW|Len}}-typed voice, she is sometimes tagged as a wild Len (野生のレン, yasei no len). Her high voice however is noted to be sweet and lovely, and therefore she can be considered a "{{NNDict|Ryouseirui}}"

As that, her voice fits well to cute Rock and Pop songs. She also often covers Rin Len original songs, such as her "How-to Sekai Seifuku"{{nnd|sm20328616}}, and has been noted to master both voice types equally well.

Some might know her for her duet covers with fellow utaite [[kradness]], where she would sing the Rin parts, and kradness the Len parts.

She is has been noted to be also good at drawing.
